# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Scheduling alignment {#scheduling-alignment}"
msgstr "Allineamento della schedulazione {#scheduling-alignment}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This example uses `stretch` to ensure a sequence of gates between two "
"barriers are left-aligned, whatever their actual durations are:\n"
msgstr ""
"Questo esempio usa `stretch` per garantire che una sequenza di gate tra due "
"barrier sia allineata a sinistra, indipendentemente dalle loro durate "
"effettive:\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "<DoqAdmonition type=\"note\">\n"
msgstr "<DoqAdmonition type=\"note\">\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
" When using `stretch` with Qiskit Runtime, any remainder resulting from a "
"stretch resolution is added to the first delay that uses the stretch.\n"
msgstr ""
" Quando si usa `stretch` con Qiskit Runtime, qualsiasi resto risultante "
"dalla risoluzione di uno stretch viene aggiunto al primo delay che usa lo "
"stretch.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Example:\n"
msgstr "Esempio:\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    ```python\n"
"    a = circuit.add_stretch(\"a\")\n"
"    circuit.barrier(q0, q1)\n"
"    circuit.delay(100, q0)\n"
"    circuit.delay(a, q1)  # resolve to 26\n"
"    circuit.x(q1)  # duration: 8\n"
"    circuit.delay(a, q1)  # resolve to 25\n"
"    circuit.x(q1)  # duration: 8\n"
"    circuit.delay(a, q1)  # resolve to 25\n"
"    circuit.x(q1)  # duration: 8\n"
"    circuit.barrier(q0, q1)\n"
"     ```\n"
msgstr ""
"    ```python\n"
"    a = circuit.add_stretch(\"a\")\n"
"    circuit.barrier(q0, q1)\n"
"    circuit.delay(100, q0)\n"
"    circuit.delay(a, q1)  # resolve to 26\n"
"    circuit.x(q1)  # duration: 8\n"
"    circuit.delay(a, q1)  # resolve to 25\n"
"    circuit.x(q1)  # duration: 8\n"
"    circuit.delay(a, q1)  # resolve to 25\n"
"    circuit.x(q1)  # duration: 8\n"
"    circuit.barrier(q0, q1)\n"
"     ```\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The above code resolves to a value of 25 with a remainder of 1. The first "
"delay`[a]` will have the remainder added.\n"
msgstr ""
"Il codice precedente si risolve in un valore di 25 con un resto di 1. Al "
"primo delay`[a]` verrà aggiunto il resto.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Stretch resolution equation:  $a + 8 + a + 8 + a + 8 = 100   =   3*a + 24$\n"
msgstr ""
"Equazione di risoluzione dello stretch:  $a + 8 + a + 8 + a + 8 = 100   =   "
"3*a + 24$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "</DoqAdmonition>\n"
msgstr "</DoqAdmonition>\n"

